   "kind": 1,
   "value": "> **Rerun status, 2026-10-13:** all 9 code cells now run in the live kernel with native outputs (the 'No code cell has been run' banner above is historical). Reproduced: sections 1a-1e (L = 3 exact; L = 4 exact in 259 s: pair-1 word True, ranks 25 and 26), section 2 (L = 3 untwisting, 7.5 min), 3 (direction independence 10.6 min; the finite-twist z2 != z3 residuals 5.25e-3, 5.25e-4, ... reproduced to 4 digits), 4 (Q-form). **Discrepancy:** the python F1/F2 (and G) columns of the section-2 table are swapped relative to the family definitions (see the note under cell 20); the physics claim is unaffected. **Fixes:** cell 20 (whole-wxf import replaced by `hw_L3.json`, memoisation for speed), Q-form cell (unclosed `Max[`; 0/0 guard).",
