  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 0. Setup\n\nVector-form fused transfer matrices on bras (diagonal twist), exact or numeric; a batch of bras is passed as a {4^N, nb} matrix. `ebChanged[v, as]` lists the pairs on which the bra v is *not* the factor W_{a_n} (pairs equal to W_{a_n} factor out).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ebE[i_, j_] := Normal[SparseArray[{{i, j} -> 1}, {4, 4}]];\nebRho[\"A\"][a_, b_] := ebE[a, b];\nebRho[\"F\"][a_, b_] := -ebE[b, a];\nebD[k_] := ebD[k] = Module[{eps}, Table[D[Minors[IdentityMatrix[4] + eps ebE[a, b], k], eps] /. eps -> 0, {a, 4}, {b, 4}]];\nebS[k_, ty_] := ebS[k, ty] = Module[{n = Binomial[4, k]}, Table[Sum[ebD[k][[a, b, i, j]] ebRho[ty][a, b], {a, 4}, {b, 4}], {i, n}, {j, n}]];\nebZeroQ[x_] := If[ExactNumberQ[x], x == 0, Abs[x] < 10.^-11];\nebGf[ty_, k_, u_, t_, h_] := If[ty == \"A\", Table[u - t - j h, {j, 1, k - 1}], Table[u - t - j h, {j, 0, k - 2}]];\nebPref[k_, u_, ch_, reg_] := Times @@ Flatten[MapThread[If[TrueQ[reg], Select[ebGf[#1, k, u, #2, ch[\"h\"]], Function[f, ! ebZeroQ[f]]], ebGf[#1, k, u, #2, ch[\"h\"]]] &, {ch[\"types\"], ch[\"th\"]}]];\nebLaxMat[k_, ty_, u_, t_, h_] := Module[{n = Binomial[4, k], tt = If[ty == \"A\", t, t + (k - 1) h]},\n   ArrayFlatten[Table[(u - tt) KroneckerDelta[i, j] IdentityMatrix[4] + h ebS[k, ty][[i, j]], {i, n}, {j, n}]]];\nebApplyT[k_, u_, psi_, ch_, reg_: False] := Module[{ns = Length[ch[\"types\"]], n = Binomial[4, k], nb, flat, phi, lm, a, b, wg, out},\n   nb = If[MatrixQ[psi], Last[Dimensions[psi]], 1]; flat = Flatten[psi];\n   phi = Table[If[i == j, flat, 0 flat], {i, n}, {j, n}];\n   Do[a = 4^(s - 1); b = 4^(ns - s) nb;\n    lm = ebLaxMat[k, ch[\"types\"][[s]], u, ch[\"th\"][[s]], ch[\"h\"]];\n    phi = Flatten[Transpose[ArrayReshape[phi, {n, n, a, 4, b}], {1, 4, 2, 5, 3}], {{1}, {2}, {3}, {4, 5}}] . lm;\n    phi = ArrayReshape[Transpose[ArrayReshape[phi, {n, a, b, n, 4}], {1, 3, 5, 2, 4}], {n, n, 4^ns nb}], {s, ns}];\n   wg = Diagonal[Minors[DiagonalMatrix[ch[\"z\"]], k]];\n   out = ebPref[k, u, ch, reg] Sum[wg[[i]] phi[[i, i]], {i, n}];\n   If[MatrixQ[psi], ArrayReshape[out, Dimensions[psi]], out]];\nebChain[thF_List, z_List, h_: 1/2] := <|\"types\" -> Flatten[ConstantArray[{\"A\", \"F\"}, Length[thF]]], \"th\" -> Flatten[{# + 2 h, #} & /@ thF], \"h\" -> h, \"z\" -> z|>;\nebW[a_] := {{1, 0, 0, a}, {-a, 0, 0, 1}};\nebProd[vs_List] := Flatten[Fold[Outer[Times, #1, #2] &, First[vs], Rest[vs]]];\nebWstate[as_List] := ebProd[Flatten[ebW /@ as, 1]];\nebLam[ch_, k_, u_, p_] := Times @@ Select[Flatten[Table[If[n == p, {}, With[{tA = ch[\"th\"][[2 n - 1]], tF = ch[\"th\"][[2 n]], h = ch[\"h\"]},\n        Join[Table[u - tA - j h, {j, 0, k - 1}], {u - tF - k h}, Table[u - tF - j h, {j, 0, k - 2}]]]], {n, Length[ch[\"th\"]]/2}]], Function[f, ! ebZeroQ[f]]];\nebXs[ch_, psi_, p_] := Module[{uF = ch[\"th\"][[2 p]], h = ch[\"h\"], x3},\n   x3 = ebApplyT[3, uF + h, psi, ch, True];\n   {ebApplyT[1, uF, psi, ch], ebApplyT[2, uF + h, psi, ch], x3, ebApplyT[1, uF, x3, ch]}];\nebKcoef[ch_, p_, kap_, y_] := Module[{uF = ch[\"th\"][[2 p]], h = ch[\"h\"], z = ch[\"z\"], s, l1, l2, l3},\n   s = 1 - kap (z[[1]] + z[[4]]); l1 = ebLam[ch, 1, uF, p]; l2 = ebLam[ch, 2, uF + h, p]; l3 = ebLam[ch, 3, uF + h, p];\n   {s^2, kap s/(h^2 l1), kap s/(2 h^4 y l2), kap s/(6 h^5 y^2 l3), kap^2/(24 h^7 y^2 l1 l3)}];\nebApplyK[ch_, psi_, p_, kap_, y_] := ebKcoef[ch, p, kap, y] . Prepend[ebXs[ch, psi, p], psi];\nebPairIsW[vec_, n_, lp_, a_] := Module[{m = ArrayReshape[vec, {16^(n - 1), 16, 16^(lp - n)}], w = ebProd[ebW[a]], q},\n   q = IdentityMatrix[16] - Outer[Times, w, w]/(w . w);\n   AllTrue[Flatten[q . Transpose[m, {2, 1, 3}]], ebZeroQ]];\nebChanged[vec_, as_List] := Select[Range[Length[as]], ! ebPairIsW[vec, #, Length[as], as[[#]]] &];\nebMonos[ch_, ref_, l_] := Module[{vecs = {ref}}, Do[vecs = Flatten[Function[v, Prepend[ebXs[ch, v, p], v]] /@ vecs, 1], {p, l}]; vecs];\nebh = 1/2; eby = 5/4; ebz = {3/2, eby, eby, 4/7}; ebthF = {-3/5, -11/8, -7/9, 5/6}; eba = 1/3;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
