   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 1. ℓ-pair words\n\n### 1a. Operator identities at u₀ = θ_F + h; pair-1 word; pair-p words for p ≥ 2 (L = 3, exact)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ebT1a = Module[{ch = ebChain[Take[ebthF, 3], ebz], rb, u0 = ebthF[[1]] + ebh, ref, rows = {}},\n   rb = ebProd[Table[RandomInteger[{-4, 4}, 4]/3, 6]];\n   AppendTo[rows, {\"t2(u0) = t1(u0) t1(thF) on a random product bra\", ebApplyT[2, u0, rb, ch] == ebApplyT[1, u0, ebApplyT[1, ebthF[[1]], rb, ch], ch]}];\n   AppendTo[rows, {\"t3(u0) = 0 (full, with prefactor)\", AllTrue[ebApplyT[3, u0, rb, ch], # == 0 &]}];\n   ref = ebWstate[{eba, eba, eba}];\n   Do[With[{ap = eba (1 - kap ebz[[4]])/(1 - kap ebz[[1]])},\n      AppendTo[rows, {\"kappa = \" <> ToString[kap, InputForm] <> \": <W_a^3|K^(1) = (1-k z1)^2 <W_a' W_a W_a|\", ebApplyK[ch, ref, 1, kap, eby] == (1 - kap ebz[[1]])^2 ebWstate[{ap, eba, eba}]}];\n      Do[AppendTo[rows, {\"kappa = \" <> ToString[kap, InputForm] <> \": pairs changed by K^(\" <> ToString[p] <> \") on <W_a^3|\", ebChanged[ebApplyK[ch, ref, p, kap, eby], {eba, eba, eba}]}], {p, 2, 3}]],\n    {kap, {3/10, -7/5, 1/ebz[[4]]}}];\n   rows];\nGrid[Prepend[ebT1a, {\"check (L = 3 pairs, exact)\", \"result\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
