      {
       "data": "Out[26]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{L} & \\text{l} & \\text{kappa} & \\text{naive prod\\_p K\\^{}(p) works} & \\text{rank(monomials)} & \\text{rank(monomials + target)}\\\\\\hline2 & 2 & \\frac{3}{10} & \\mathrm{False} & 25 & 26\\\\\\hline2 & 2 & \\frac{7}{4} & \\mathrm{False} & 25 & 26\\\\\\hline3 & 2 & \\frac{3}{10} & \\mathrm{False} & 25 & 26\\\\\\hline3 & 2 & \\frac{7}{4} & \\mathrm{False} & 25 & 26\\\\\\hline3 & 3 & \\frac{3}{10} & \\mathrm{False} & 125 & 126\\\\\\hline3 & 3 & \\frac{7}{4} & \\mathrm{False} & 125 & 126\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "13349b7e-85d5-4d63-92c8-15fdbfe04720"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Python results [exact]** (`task1b.py`, `task1c.py`, `task1i.py`).\n\n| L | ℓ | κ | naive product | rank(monomials) | rank(+ target) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 2 | 2 | 3/10, 7/4 | False | 25 | 26 |\n| 3 | 2 | 3/10, 7/4 | False | 25 | 26 |\n| 3 | 3 | 3/10, 7/4 | False | 125 | 126 |\n| 4 | 2 | 3/10, 7/4 | False | 25 | 26 (`task1k.py`) |\n\n**The common-κ ℓ-pair word does not exist in the multilinear span** (full rank, target outside). Larger word sets (L = 3, ℓ = 2, monomials ∏_p X₁^i X₂^j X₃^k of per-pair degree ≤ d): d = 1: 16 monomials, not in span; d = 2: 100 monomials (rank 100), not in span; d = 3: 400 monomials span the whole 285-dimensional cyclic module of ⟨W_a^3\\| (pair-1 operators alone already generate it), so the target is reached only trivially, with no locality — not a word. Pair-1-only monomials of degree ≤ 6 (84): not in span.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 1c. Block localisation and the W-type product states in the span (L = 3, exact)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ebU = {ebProd[{{1, 0, 0, 0}, {0, 0, 0, 1}}], ebProd[{{0, 0, 0, 1}, {0, 0, 0, 1}}] - ebProd[{{1, 0, 0, 0}, {1, 0, 0, 0}}], -ebProd[{{0, 0, 0, 1}, {1, 0, 0, 0}}]};\nebT1c = Module[{ch3 = ebChain[Take[ebthF, 3], ebz], ch2 = ebChain[Take[ebthF, 2], ebz], m3, m2, wa = ebProd[ebW[eba]], blk, u9, ns},\n   m3 = ebMonos[ch3, ebWstate[{eba, eba, eba}], 2]; m2 = ebMonos[ch2, ebWstate[{eba, eba}], 2];\n   blk = Table[MatrixRank[{m3[[i]], Flatten[Outer[Times, m2[[i]], wa]]}] == 1, {i, 25}];\n   u9 = Flatten[Table[Flatten[Outer[Times, Flatten[Outer[Times, ebU[[i]], ebU[[j]]]], wa]], {i, 3}, {j, 3}], 1];\n   ns = NullSpace[Transpose[Join[m3, -u9]]];\n   {AllTrue[blk, TrueQ], Length[ns], Take[#, -9] & /@ ns}];\nGrid[{{\"all 25 multilinear monomials block-localise: <W_a^3|m = lambda_m (<W_a^2|m on 2 pairs) (x) W_a\", ebT1c[[1]]},\n  {\"dim of span(monomials) intersected with span{u_i (x) u_j} (x) W_a\", ebT1c[[2]]},\n  {\"intersection basis (coefficients of u_i (x) u_j, i, j = 0, 1, 2)\", Column[ebT1c[[3]]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
