  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Python results [exact]** (`task1k.py`, `task1h.py`; L = 3 and L = 4, every p, κ ∈ {3/10, 1/z₄}).\n\n- ⟨W_{ar}^{p−1}⊗W_a^{L−p+1}\\|K^(p)_κ = (1−κz₁)²⟨W_{ar}^{p−1}⊗W_a′⊗W_a^{L−p}\\| — **True** for all p (L = 3, 4).\n- (X₃X₁)^(p) = K^(p) at κ₀ = 1/(z₁+z₄) (s = 0): ⟨…\\|(X₃X₁)^(p) = 24h⁷y²λ₁λ₃z₄²⟨… W_{ar} at pair p …\\| — **True**.\n- Chain word (X₃X₁)^(1)⋯(X₃X₁)^(p−1)K^(p)_κ on ⟨W_a^L\\| = c(1−κz₁)²⟨W_{ar}^{p−1}⊗W_a′⊗W_a^{L−p}\\| — **True** (L = 3: p = 2, 3; L = 4: p = 2, 3, 4).\n- Right-end words: Y₁ = t₁(θ_{A,L}), Y₂ = t₂(θ_{A,L}), Y₃ = t̂₃(θ_{A,L}+h) and Y₁Y₃ change only pair L; Y₁², Y₁Y₂, Y₂², Y₂Y₃, Y₃² change all pairs. {1, Y₁, Y₂, Y₃, Y₁Y₃} rotate pair L freely (intersection with W_a^{L−1}⊗span{u_i}: dim 3). Left × right products (25): W-type intersection with {W_b⊗W_a⊗W_c} is again only {W_b⊗W_a⊗W_a} + {W_a⊗W_a⊗W_c} (dim 5) — the first and last pair cannot be rotated together either.\n\n**Answer to task 1.** ∏_p K^(p)_{κ_p} localises and rotates **iff κ₁ = … = κ_{ℓ−1} = 1/(z₁+z₄)**: the pairs to the left of the free one must carry the fixed inverse twist Λ⁻¹ (cycling the aux trace past them conjugates them by the twist). The alternating-chain analogue of 2603's loc3 is the **end-growing chain** (one free pair at the growing end), not a common-κ block; no corrected combination exists in the multilinear (or per-pair degree ≤ 2) span. ℓ = L: (X₃X₁)^(1…L) = global Λ⁻¹; the common-κ global rotation ρ(1−κΛ) commutes with all t's and acts on eigenstates by the weight factor (§2, family G).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 1e. L = 4 pairs (65536-dim): pair-1 word and the 2-pair span\n\nExact rationals in Wolfram are slow here (several minutes, ~1 GB); python used arithmetic mod P.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ebT1f = Module[{ch = ebChain[ebthF, ebz], ref = ebWstate[ConstantArray[eba, 4]], kap = 3/10, ap, mons},\n   ap = eba (1 - kap ebz[[4]])/(1 - kap ebz[[1]]);\n   mons = ebMonos[ch, ref, 2];\n   {ebApplyK[ch, ref, 1, kap, eby] == (1 - kap ebz[[1]])^2 ebWstate[{ap, eba, eba, eba}], MatrixRank[mons], MatrixRank[Append[mons, ebWstate[{ap, ap, eba, eba}]]]}];\nGrid[{{\"L = 4: <W_a^4|K^(1) = (1-k z1)^2 <W_a' W_a^3|\", ebT1f[[1]]}, {\"rank of the 25 multilinear monomials (pairs 1, 2)\", ebT1f[[2]]}, {\"rank with target <W_a'^2 W_a^2|\", ebT1f[[3]]}}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725119\" data-output-id=\"230\" data-out-n=\"34\" data-sub-idx=\"1\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"16\" data-sub-start=\"4\" data-sub-end=\"4\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[34]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"17\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.64em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">L = 4: &lt;W_a</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">4|K</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">(1) = (1-k z1)</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">2 &lt;W_a’ W_a</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">3|</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rank of the 25 multilinear monomials (pairs 1, 2)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rank with target &lt;W_a’</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">2 W_a</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">2|</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">25</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">26</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[34]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{L = 4: <W\\_a\\^{}4|K\\^{}(1) = (1-k z1)\\^{}2 <W\\_a' W\\_a\\^{}3|} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{rank of the 25 multilinear monomials (pairs 1, 2)} & 25\\\\\\hline\\text{rank with target <W\\_a'\\^{}2 W\\_a\\^{}2|} & 26\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
