  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Python results [exact mod P]** (`task1k.py`, 8 s): pair-1 word **True** (κ = 3/10, 1/z₄); pretwisted words and chain words True for p = 1…4; 25 multilinear monomials rank 25, with target rank 26 (κ = 3/10 and 7/4) — **ℓ = 2 not reachable at L = 4**.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. Even bridges at L = 3 through the untwisting limit\n\n**What the one-pair word gives (HW trick, both shifts).** ⟨W_a′⊗W_a^{L−1}\\|Ψ⟩ = K_κ(τ)⟨W_a^L\\|Ψ⟩/(1−κz₁)² exactly at finite twist. For an untwisted HW Ψ₀ a global e^{bE₁₄} is free: shifting by −a gives ⟨W_{a′−a}⊗vac^{L−1}\\| (**M = 1** when a′−a = −1), shifting by −a′ gives ⟨vac⊗W_{a−a′}^{L−1}\\| (**M = L−1** when a−a′ = −1). Also C_M = (−1)^{L+μ₄}C_{L−M} for HW states (shift by +1, then ρ(diag(1,1,1,−1)) maps W_b → −W_{−b}). So the one-pair word covers M = 1 and M = L−1 at every L — at L = 3 every even bridge. Families:\n\n| family | κ | a | limit bra (via HW trick + cyclicity) | data |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| F1 | 1/(z₁ − a(z₁−z₄)) (a′−a = −1) | 1/3 | ⟨W₋₁⊗vac²\\|, M = 1 | C₄ |\n| F2 | 1/(z₁ + a(z₁−z₄)) (a′−a = +1) | 1/3 | ⟨vac⊗W₋₁²\\|, M = 2 | C₂ |\n| F3 | 1/z₄ (a′ = 0) | −1 | ⟨vac⊗W₋₁²\\|, M = 2 | C₂ |\n| F4 | 1/z₄ | +1 | shift −1: ⟨W₋₁⊗vac²\\|, M = 1 | C₄ |\n| G | as F1, global ρ(1−κΛ) | 1/3 | ⟨W₋₁³\\|, M = 3 | C₀ |\n\nG: ⟨W_a′^L\\|Ψ⟩ = [(1−κz₄)/(1−κz₁)]^L ∏_i(1−κz_i)^{μ_i}·⟨W_a^L\\|Ψ⟩ (weight μ of Ψ). Twisted chain: z = 1 + εφ, φ = (0.9, 0.35, 0.35, −1.1), θ_{F,n} = ε(0, 0.37, −0.52), θ_A = θ_F + 2h, h = 1/2; Ψ₀ = the 26 HW cyclic states of `data/abjm-hw-states.wxf` (key L3; field C_ℓ = ⟨B_ℓ\\|ψ⟩, first ℓ sites O₂); twisted state = eigenvector of a generic t-combination in the weight sector of Ψ₀ with maximal overlap.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* fixed 2026-10-13: do not Import the whole wxf (its L4 key is 3 GB in memory); read the L3 states from the JSON export instead *)\nebHWraw = Import[\"C:/Users/pryan/git-projects/abjm-c123/Paul/Mathematica/su4-alternating/checks/session-2026-10-13/epsexp/hw_L3.json\", \"RawJSON\"];\nebHW = Table[<|\"psi\" -> N[ebHWraw[\"psiRe\"][[i]] + I ebHWraw[\"psiIm\"][[i]]], \"w\" -> ebHWraw[\"w\"][[i]], \"dyn\" -> ebHWraw[\"dyn\"][[i]], \"E\" -> ebHWraw[\"E\"][[i]],\n     \"C\" -> N[ebHWraw[\"CRe\"][[i]] + I ebHWraw[\"CIm\"][[i]]]|>, {i, Length[ebHWraw[\"w\"]]}];\nebTypes3 = Flatten[ConstantArray[{\"A\", \"F\"}, 3]];\nebWt = Map[Total[MapThread[If[#2 == \"A\", 1, -1] UnitVector[4, #1] &, {#, ebTypes3}]] &, Tuples[Range[4], 6]];\nebSect = GroupBy[Range[4096], ebWt[[#]] &];\n(* fixed 2026-10-13 (speed): the sector matrices are memoised, otherwise ebEig rebuilds the same matrix for every state of a sector (the cell then took > 10 min) *)\nClearAll[ebSectorMatrix];\nebSectorMatrix[ch_, ops_, sec_] := ebSectorMatrix[ch, ops, sec] = Module[{d = Length[sec], m, chunk = 32},\n   m = ConstantArray[0. I, {d, d}];\n   Do[Module[{idx = sec[[b0 ;; Min[b0 + chunk - 1, d]]], e, acc},\n     e = Normal[SparseArray[Table[{idx[[q]], q}, {q, Length[idx]}] -> 1., {4096, Length[idx]}]];\n     acc = Sum[op[[1]] ebApplyT[op[[2]], op[[3]], e, ch, op[[4]]], {op, ops}];\n     m[[b0 ;; b0 + Length[idx] - 1]] = Transpose[acc[[sec]]]], {b0, 1, d, chunk}];\n   m];   (* m[[p,q]] = (e_p . t)_q on the sector; ket action m . psi *)\nebGen = {{1., 1, 0.37, False}, {0.61, 3, -0.29, True}, {0.23, 2, 0.83, False}};\nebNumChain[eps_, phi_, thdir_, zf_: None] := ebChain[eps thdir, If[zf === None, 1. + eps phi, zf[eps]], 0.5];\nebTwisted[ch_, ids_] := Association[Flatten[KeyValueMap[Function[{w, is}, Module[{sec = ebSect[w], vals, vecs},\n        {vals, vecs} = Eigensystem[ebSectorMatrix[ch, ebGen, sec]];\n        Table[Module[{p0 = ebHW[[i]][\"psi\"][[sec]], ovs, m, v, psi},\n          ovs = Abs[Conjugate[vecs] . p0]/(Norm /@ vecs); m = First[Ordering[ovs, -1]];\n          v = Normalize[vecs[[m]]]; v = v Exp[-I Arg[Conjugate[p0] . v]];\n          psi = ConstantArray[0. I, 4096]; psi[[sec]] = v; i -> {psi, ovs[[m]]/Norm[p0], sec}], {i, is}]]],\n      GroupBy[ids, ebHW[[#]][\"w\"] &]]]];\nebEig[ch_, psi_, sec_, k_, u_, reg_: False] := With[{v = psi[[sec]], m = ebSectorMatrix[ch, {{1., k, u, reg}}, sec]}, (Conjugate[v] . (m . v))/(Conjugate[v] . v)];\nebTaus[ch_, psi_, sec_] := With[{uF = ch[\"th\"][[2]], h = ch[\"h\"]}, {ebEig[ch, psi, sec, 1, uF], ebEig[ch, psi, sec, 2, uF + h], ebEig[ch, psi, sec, 3, uF + h, True]}];\nebKval[ch_, taus_, kap_, y_] := ebKcoef[ch, 1, kap, y] . {1, taus[[1]], taus[[2]], taus[[3]], taus[[3]] taus[[1]]};\nebFam[ch_, psi_, taus_, fam_] := Module[{z = ch[\"z\"], a, kap, ap},\n   {a, kap} = Switch[fam, \"F1\", {1/3, 1/(z[[1]] - (z[[1]] - z[[4]])/3)}, \"F2\", {1/3, 1/(z[[1]] + (z[[1]] - z[[4]])/3)}, \"F3\", {-1, 1/z[[4]]}, \"F4\", {1, 1/z[[4]]}];\n   ap = a (1 - kap z[[4]])/(1 - kap z[[1]]);\n   {ebKval[ch, taus, kap, z[[2]]] (ebWstate[{a, a, a}] . psi)/(1 - kap z[[1]])^2, ebWstate[{ap, a, a}] . psi}];   (* {RHS, LHS} *)\nebGlob[ch_, psi_, mu_] := Module[{z = ch[\"z\"], kap, ap, pg},\n   kap = 1/(z[[1]] - (z[[1]] - z[[4]])/3); ap = (1/3) (1 - kap z[[4]])/(1 - kap z[[1]]);\n   pg = ((1 - kap z[[4]])/(1 - kap z[[1]]))^3 Times @@ ((1 - kap z)^mu);\n   {pg (ebWstate[{1/3, 1/3, 1/3}] . psi), ebWstate[{ap, ap, ap}] . psi}];\nebPhi = {0.9, 0.35, 0.35, -1.1}; ebThdir = {0., 0.37, -0.52};\nebRun2 = Table[Module[{ch = ebNumChain[eps, ebPhi, ebThdir], st},\n     st = ebTwisted[ch, Range[26]];\n     Table[Module[{psi = st[i][[1]], sec = st[i][[3]], taus, c = ebHW[[i]][\"C\"]},\n       taus = ebTaus[ch, psi, sec];\n       Join[{eps, i, st[i][[2]]}, Table[Abs[First[ebFam[ch, psi, taus, f]] - c[[If[MemberQ[{\"F1\", \"F4\"}, f], 5, 3]]]], {f, {\"F1\", \"F2\", \"F3\", \"F4\"}}],\n        {Abs[First[ebGlob[ch, psi, ebHW[[i]][\"w\"]]] - c[[1]]]}]], {i, 26}]], {eps, {10.^-2, 10.^-3, 10.^-4}}];\nGrid[Prepend[Select[Flatten[ebRun2, 1], MemberQ[{1, 17, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22}, #[[2]]] &],\n  {\"eps\", \"state #\", \"overlap\", \"|F1 - C4|\", \"|F2 - C2|\", \"|F3 - C2|\", \"|F4 - C4|\", \"|G - C0|\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725119\" data-output-id=\"231\" data-out-n=\"68\" data-sub-idx=\"19\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"19\" data-sub-start=\"43\" data-sub-end=\"44\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[68]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"17\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:26.44em;vertical-align:-12.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:13.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-15.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:15.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:26.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-12.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:13.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-15.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eps</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-14.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-13.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span></span></span><span