       "data": "{\n\t\"name\": \"WolframKernelMessage\",\n\t\"message\": \"Det::luc: Result for Det of badly conditioned matrix {{6381.98 + 0. I, 5098.51 + 0. I, 4067.8 + 0. I}, {-6.39716 10   + 0. I, -5.11773 10   + 0. I, -4.09418 10   + 0. I}, {0.370789 + 0. I, 1.12956 + 0. I, 3.05442 + 0. I}} may contain significant numerical errors.\\nDet::luc: Result for Det of badly conditioned matrix {{6057.77 + 0. I, 4840.9 + 0. I, 3863.92 + 0. I}, {-6.39716 10   + 0. I, -5.11773 10   + 0. I, -4.09418 10   + 0. I}, {0.302086 + 0. I, 0.930784 + 0. I, 2.61266 + 0. I}} may contain significant numerical errors.\\nDet::luc: Result for Det of badly conditioned matrix {{5749.69 + 0. I, 4595.86 + 0. I, 3669.76 + 0. I}, {-6.39716 10   + 0. I, -5.11773 10   + 0. I, -4.09418 10   + 0. I}, {0.25171 + 0. I, 0.759493 + 0. I, 2.21213 + 0. I}} may contain significant numerical errors.\\nGeneral::stop: Further output of Det::luc will be suppressed during this calculation.\",\n\t\"stack\": \"\"\n}",
